(input) the set of instances of the entity data type <<express:qualifications_schema.qualification_type,qualification_type>> that the function is searching for in the <<express:qualifications_schema.qualification_type_relationship.relating_qualification_type,relating_qualification_type>> parameter of the **relation** argument.
